IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `aca-citizenship`

-- Australian Citizenship Act 2007 (Cth), with the Australian Citizenship Regulation 2016 and the Transitionals Act 2007
-- Sch 3 item 4 -- worked cases from the seat of the child and the applicant.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked against a
-- decided case, the 1948 Act (not deposited) or departmental policy.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_australian-citizenship-act-2007_baseline.py).
-- Expected results were written by hand from the text.
--
-- Facts the lives do not state are ASSUMPTIONS, labelled where used: Graham's and Sue's citizenship at Chloe's and Jake's
-- births; that Chloe, Jake and Oliver lived in Australia for their first ten years; Priya's application date (1 Mar 2030) and
-- approval date (15 May 2030); when the London year ended; Anjali's approval date (1 Sep 2027) and that she applied alone.

-- Births. The lives call Chloe, Jake and Daniel citizens "by birth (s 12)". Graham and Sue are given no citizenship: ASSUMED
-- citizens. Daniel's father Giuseppe was "Australian citizen by conferral 1995" (a 1948 Act citizen at Daniel's birth).
